  "description": "ToolUp.AI.Wire — the portable, Fable-compilable JSON substrate: the one closed JSON value model (numbers as their lexical tokens), its text parser and its one writer, ergonomic builders and total accessors, plus the provider connector contract and the pure streaming state machine. Shared by server and browser hosts. FSharp.Core + Fable.Core only — no System.Net.Http, no System.Text.Json.",
